        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "23e45e09-d2d6-5eed-bda3-d8cf3a900606",
        "text": "Page: Enter Sandman. Sentence: \"Enter Sandman\" is a song by American heavy metal band Metallica.\nPage: Enter Sandman. Sentence: Vocalist and rhythm guitarist Hetfield wrote the lyrics, which deal with the concept of a child's nightmares.\nPage: Metallica (album). Sentence: \"Metallica\" produced five singles that are considered to be among the band's best-known songs, which include \"Enter Sandman\", \"The Unforgiven\", \"Nothing Else Matters\", \"Wherever I May Roam\", and \"Sad but True\". \"\nPage: Death Magnetic. Sentence: It was the band's first album to be produced by Rick Rubin, making this their first album since \"\"Metallica\"\" (1991) not to be produced by Bob Rock.",
